<title>AUSTRIA: Bank Austria says 9-mth result up on 95.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria says 9-mth result up on 95.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Austria's finished the first nine months of this year ahead of the same period in 1995, chief executive Gerhard Randa said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We were above last year's level after nine months,&quot; Randa said at an investment fair. He gave no details.</p>
<p>In the first nine months of 1995 Bank Austria reported a parent operating profit of 3.292 billion schillings. -- Vienna Newsroom, 43-1-53112-258</p>
